        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin 6542 Classic Mortise Tremont Handleset with 5020 Colonial Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe elegance of the Baldwin Tremont Handleset is evident in the beveled edges of both the inside and the outside plates. Along with the 5020 Colonial Knob, the 6542 Mortise Handleset exudes a classic beauty that will surely add a richness to any space. It will fit 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\" door thicknesses and with backsets of 2-1/2\" or 2-3/4\". It is available as a dummy set or as a single cylinder function.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMortise locks have been, and still are, the established norm for Europe and much of the rest of the world. In the early 1960’s Baldwin brought residential mortise locks to America. They ‘founded’ the residential mortise industry and continue to be the leader – so much so that their competitors have bought Baldwin locks for their own homes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>Also Available: Matching <a href=\"/products/colonial-knobset-baldwin-5020\"><b>Baldwin 5020 Colonial Knobset</b></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Traditional 6542 Tremont Door Entrance Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid forged brass for maximum strength and durability.</li>\r\n<li>Heavy duty steel mortise lock body for a lifetime of trouble-free operation.  </li>\r\n<li>Mortise locks have adjustable forged brass lock fronts, protected by armored scalp fronts for ultimate strength and protection against tampering.</li>\r\n<li>Forged brass and steel mechanical.</li>\r\n<li>Locks and strikes fit standard ANSI A115.1 preparation.</li>\r\n<li>Reinforced steel security strike with three inch screws.</li>\r\n<li>Anti friction latch bolt with 3/4” throw.  </li>\r\n<li>1” throw deadbolt has two hardened steel inserts for maximum protection and security.</li>\r\n<li>7mm hub broached on the diamond</li>\r\n<li>Certified by Underwriters Laboratories (UL) for use on fire doors up to three-hour rating.</li>\r\n<li><b>Lifetime Limited Warranty</b> on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Classic Estates Collection Tremont Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Interior Trim: 5020 Knob</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Length: 17\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Width: 3-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Length: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Thickness: 11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Exterior Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Length: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Width: 3-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Thickness: 11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Knob Diameter: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Interior Projection: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Hub to Turn Piece Length: 2.25\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Hub to Cylinder Length: 3.437\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" or 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset:  2-1/2\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BAL-6542.pdf?v=1691094972\" target=\"new\"><b>Tremont Handleset Specification Sheet (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BAL-estate_mortise_dimensions.pdf?v=1691094972\" target=\"new\"><b>Mortise Box Specification Sheet (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy Set:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a thumb piece operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a knob/lever operates the latch.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a thumb piece operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a key unlocks the deadbolt and a knob/lever operates the latch.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Tremont Mortise Handleset, Baldwin 6542",
                "description": "Baldwin 6542 Tremont Handleset - The elegance of the Baldwin Tremont Handleset is evident in the beveled edges of both the inside and the outside plates. Along with the 5020 Colonial Knob, the 6542 Mortise Handleset exudes a classic beauty that will surely add a richness to any space. It will fit 1-3/8 inch or 1-3/4 inch door thicknesses and with backsets of 2-1/2 inches or 2-3/4 inches. It is available as a dummy set or as a single cylinder function.",
                "keywords": "BAL-6542, baldwin 6542 Tremont handlesets, baldwin Tremont door entrance sets, single cylinder handlesets, emergency egress handlesets,  Bladwin classic Estate Collection Handlesets, traditional handlesets, classic handlesets, arched handlesets,"
